('Can Admin see both supplier purchases and customer orders?
Yes. The PulseOps Admin role is intended to have an overall view of supplier purchasing activity and customer order activity.
Can Admin approve every purchase order or edit every department''s records?
Not automatically. Organization-wide monitoring is distinct from transaction permissions. Follow configured role permissions
and approval rules.
