1. Review inventory position
Open the Inventory Dashboard and review product availability, warehouse-level stock, low-stock indicators and recent stock
movements.
2. Investigate a stock risk
Check the affected product and warehouse. Review recorded movements and determine whether the change relates to
outbound orders, adjustments, receipts or another recorded movement.
