Q: Who creates the purchase order?
A: The Procurement Manager handles purchase-order creation and approval according to company authorization rules.
Q: Can this guide tell me today''s stock quantity?
A: No. Today''s quantity must be retrieved from live, authorized PulseOps data.
Q: What if stock does not reconcile?
