('2. Validate purchasing details
Check supplier-product suitability, supplier lead time, cost information and existing open purchase orders.
3. Create purchase order
Create the PO in the Procurement Dashboard using supported application fields. Avoid duplicate orders.
4. Obtain approval
Route the PO through the configured approval process. Creation and approval are distinct actions; only authorized users may
approve.
