('2. Department workflow
1. Review supplier profile
Check the supplier''s available profile, supported products, account details and recorded operational history.
2. Review purchase-order history
Examine related POs, expected and received dates, quantities ordered and received, status and recorded delays.
3. Assess performance
Use measures actually available in the application. Consider timeliness, quantity fulfilment and repeated exceptions; do not
infer missing metrics.
