('appropriate period.
Q: Which lead time should I use?
A: Use supplier lead_time_days as the single source for supplier lead-time calculations.
Q: Who should know about a delayed supplier order?
A: Notify Procurement because the PO is affected, and escalate broader business impact to Business Operations.
Q: Can this guide identify the current best supplier?
