('Purpose
Guide the Delivery Manager in monitoring goods moving into and out of warehouses, tracking
customer deliveries, identifying delays and coordinating fulfilment exceptions.
1. Role responsibilities
 Monitor incoming supplier shipments to warehouses where represented in the application.
 Track outgoing customer orders and their delivery status.
