5. Illustrative PulseOps scenario
Illustrative example: customers order 20 iPhones. The Delivery Manager tracks the outgoing customer orders through available
fulfilment and delivery statuses until completion.
This does not assert that a particular shipment, tracking number, carrier or delivery date exists. Those details must come from
live operational records.
