('6. Example questions and grounded answers
Q: How do I find delayed deliveries?
A: Review delayed or exception views in the Delivery Dashboard and validate each case against latest recorded status and
dates.
Q: What is inbound versus outbound?
A: Inbound movement brings supplier-purchased goods into a warehouse. Outbound movement fulfils customer orders from a
warehouse toward customers.
