Q: Who handles a supplier shipment delay?
A: Coordinate with the Supplier Manager and Procurement Manager because the issue affects an inbound purchase order.
Q: Can this PDF tell me where an order is right now?
A: No. Current tracking must come from connected live order/shipment data or a delivery-partner integration.
