('Purpose
Guide the Business Operations Manager in monitoring cross-department performance,
identifying business risks and coordinating corrective action across Inventory, Procurement,
Supplier and Delivery.
1. Role responsibilities
 Monitor overall business performance and the health of all five operational roles.
 Review revenue and order measures available in the application.
 Monitor inventory availability and replenishment risk.
