('2. Identify the affected department
Determine whether an issue originates in inventory, procurement, supplier performance, inbound logistics or outbound delivery.
3. Trace dependencies
For example, a supplier delay may affect PO receipt timing, warehouse availability, replenishment risk and customer fulfilment.
4. Coordinate owners
