Q: How can a supplier delay affect the business?
A: It may delay PO receipts, reduce warehouse availability, increase stockout exposure and affect customer fulfilment. Confirm
each link using live records.
Q: Who owns a stock replenishment action?
A: Inventory identifies the need and raises the requirement; Procurement handles purchasing and PO approval according to
permissions.
