('  Sick leave may be requested during medical emergencies.
  A medical certificate may be requested for sick leave exceeding three consecutive working days.
  Unused casual leave cannot be carried forward.
  Earned leave can be carried forward up to 30 days.
  Manager approval is mandatory.
