('9. Employee Reimbursement Policy
Employees may request reimbursement for approved business expenses.
  Eligible expenses include official travel expenses.
  Approved client meeting expenses may be reimbursed.
  Work-related internet expenses may be eligible, where applicable.
  Approved training and certification expenses may be reimbursed.
  Original bills or valid receipts must be submitted.
